	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg4229"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=360" title="View the profile of Heimdall">Heimdall</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 55<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=360"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:classified67@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=537.msg4229#msg4229"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=537.msg4229#msg4229">Re:Gnos</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #31 on:</b> January 02, 2004, 11:52:25 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ya know I just love the quote function to death...<br /><br />Kinson said:<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Can&#039;t think of an intelligent insult, so you just throw random masses of profane words together hoping it gets your point across, eh Garadan?</div><br />In the same post he earlier said:<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">/shrug. Fuck her. Fuck Ascent. </div><br />In response to Grem saying:<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Gnos hit it right on the head... since you wanna say &#039;fuck Ascent&#039;... then train me you half shit ass pussy mother fucker. I promise you that you wont be able to do shit... dont write a check your ass cant cash you dumb little shit. Train me... you dont wanna see what I can bring for you... or maybe you have no idea of server politics... keep it up you might be looking for a new guild. </div><br />Now you be the judge... which string of profanity had more thought involved?<br /><br />Kinson&#039;s next stunning revelation was:<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">And guild politics...ahahahaha. As Garadan doesn&#039;t know, I doubt the rest of you &quot;uber guild&quot; folks do. There is a *HUGE* difference between &quot;uber guilds&quot; and casual guilds. </div><br />Wow. &nbsp;I&#039;m absolutely floored you could come up with that gem of knowledge. &nbsp;You just told people from the number 1 guild on the server with one of the single longest recruitment processes that there&#039;s a HUGE difference between &quot;uber guilds&quot;(you put the quotes around uber but not casual for some reason) and casual guilds. &nbsp;Isn&#039;t that kind of like telling the Party Chairman there&#039;s a difference between Republicans and Democrats?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
